From fb1fc00b155ed7b3ac0396a78d73d448a9290651 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 05:37:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] orchestration-build: jssg split on oxc and the QuickJS
 bundle on rolldown

Ports the workflow build from esbuild to Rust: the jssg() split runs on
oxc_semantic, artifacts and the workflow bundle are built with rolldown
(TypeScript stripped, async lowered for QuickJS), and bundles are cached
by the content of every input file. The specs replace build.test.ts,
quickjs-bundle.test.ts and build-cache.test.ts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
